<title>USA: Home Bancorp share buyback approved.</title>
<headline>Home Bancorp share buyback approved.</headline>
<dateline>ELGIN, Ill. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Bancorp of Elgin Inc said Wednesday its stock repurchase program was approved by the Office of Thrift Supervision.</p>
<p>Under the program, announced on May 1, the company will buy back up to 350,462 shares or five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The program will begin as soon as practicable, and continue for up to six months, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
